   {
    "id": "cxseatcheck",
    "sev": "med",
-   "state": "open",
+   "state": "in work",
    "opened": "2026-09-07",
    "title": "tools/cxlaunch.sh: a codex seat check that could report a REFUSED seat as a clean run, and a wall-grep over stderr that matched the project's own ledger text",
    "witness": "harness:controlled in four states on the day it landed -- refusal, echoed-source false positive, real wall, healthy answer; all four give the wanted disposition.",
