t.  A mismatch then reads as a DEAD OR HALLUCINATING SEAT when the seat was neither.  Quote a file nothing in the round is going to touch, or freeze the quoted line for the run. *Caught only because the verifying subagent was told IN ADVANCE to distinguish a timestamp-only difference from a real failure -- had it not been, a correct Fable ruling would have been recorded as failing its own liveness check.* — record: 2026-09-25 — [NOT A SEAT ANSWER] The re-ruling&#x27;s first firing was written by claude-opus-4-8 after a refusal by claude-fable-5-1 (agent_models.py); kept as evidence, relabelled, never counted as the seat. — record: 2026-09-26 — [NOT A SEAT ANSWER] The flagship&#x27;s first answer on repair 15&#x27;s pass 2 was written by claude-opus-4-8 after two refusals by claude-fable-5-1 (agent_models.py); relabelled, never counted as the seat.</span></span></td><td class="c pend"><span class="wrap" tabindex="0"><span class="g">…</span><span class="tip">2026-09-26 — repair 13&#x27;s 23 / 8 / 10 / 5 is reproduced exactly, and every member now has a name. The two unnamed HOST-DIAGNOSTIC members are entries 11 and 15 (CONTROL 0x0001, 4W and 8W). The six unnamed EQUIVALENT members are 12, 13, 16, 17, 43 and 44 (CONTROL writes of 0, 0x0200 and 0x0100). The counts no longer describe r17, though. Now: 31 GUEST-VISIBLE (30 rowed in both latch states; entry 34, `sd +0x40`, rowed only with the latch SET); 4 ROWED on the CONTROL-text count in both states (10, 11, 14, 15); 1 HOST-DIAGNOSTIC ONLY (40); 10 EQUIVALENT. All 92 entry x latch cells were MEASURED, and 92 of 92 matched predictions written before any run. — #529 the Opus 5 MEASURING seat on the contract&#x27;s ACCEPTS-46 buckets (GPT-6 Astra&#x27;s confirmation of the 09-25 re-ruling asked for an L4 enumeration with justified dispositions).  Verbatim verdict: repair 13&#x27;s 23 / 8 / 10 / 5 is reproduced exactly, and every member now has a name. The two unnamed HOST-DIAGNOSTIC members are entries 11 and 15 (CONTROL 